'''Codename "Red Riding"''' (わんこずきんミーニャ ''Wanko Zukin Mīnya'', '''Dog Hood Minya''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[Learned to Love]], which has a chance to unlock her [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] counterpart [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Red Riding Mina]] when completed. She was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

