|money drop = 5,000¢ - 19,750¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy's attack cycle lasts a little more than 20 seconds, but these [[Long Distance]] attacks can hit up to 3,700 range away from her, so try to prevent her from advancing more than 1/5th of the battlefield, as she will easily hit the [[Cat Base]]. If she does hit the base, though, you still have some time to beat her before it's too late, as her DPS is pretty low for a Long Distance enemy. She also has a huge blind spot of 2,800 and no immunities, which can be exploited by some units.

In [[Learned to Love]] and [[Learned to Hate]], you can lure her to your base so that her attack hits the base without killing any cats that you deploy. However, in order for this to work, you have to synchronize and kill the [[H. Nah]]s quickly and rush towards "Red Riding" before the [[Le'noir]]s and [[Sunfish Jones]] get in the way. On higher difficulties, [[Cat Combo]]s may be required to deal with the H. Nahs before it's too late.

